# Smoke: an accepted Discovery to the first accepted decision.
id: adr-smoke
skill: highway-adr
fixture: discovery
smoke: yes
open: /highway-adr Weekly Order Restock Alerts Options
ask: Which option would you like to select?
say: [select] 1
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
writes: adrs/adrs.md
writes: adrs/*.md
expect: template adrs/adrs.md :: adr-catalog.md
expect: template adrs/ADR*.md :: adr-record.md
